<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/"><rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#"><rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about=""><dc:description><rdf:Alt><rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">This book is a hands-on guide to mastering quantum computing. Learn to build quantum circuits, create algorithms, and run experiments using IBM Quantum and Qiskit, bridging theory and real-world applications.</rdf:li>
